#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, intoPageLabel)
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:163
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Welcome to the <b>KStars Telescope Setup Wizard!</b>\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"This Wizard will help you to connect to your telescope and control it from "
"KStars. You will be asked to verify some basic information.\n"
"<br>\n"
"<br>You can get extended information on telescope support in KStars by "
"pressing the <tt>help</tt> button at any point during the Wizard.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Please click next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Bienveníu al <b>Asistente de configuración del telescopiu de KStars</b> \n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Esti asistente va ayudate a coneutar el so telescopiu y remanalu dende "
"KStars. Solicitaráse-y que verifique información enforma básica.\n"
"<br>\n"
"<br>Puede obtener información enantada sobro'l soporte de telescopios en "
"KStars calcando'l botón <tt>ayuda</tt> en cualesquier intre durante la "
"execución del asistente.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Calque «Siguiente» pa continuar."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, modelPageLabel)
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:199
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h3>1. Telescope Model</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Please select your telescope model from the list below. Click next after "
"selecting a model."
msgstr ""
"<h3>1. Modelu de telescopiu</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Por favor, esbille'l so modelu de telescopiu na llista inferior. Calque "
"«Siguiente» dempués d'esbillar un modelu."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, textLabel1)
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:274
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Tip</b>\n"
"<br>Some non-Meade telescopes support a subset of the LX200 command set. "
"Select <tt>LX200 Basic</tt> to control such devices."
msgstr ""
"<b>Nota</b>\n"
"<br>Dalgunos telescopios que nun son Meade soporten un soconxuntu de les "
"órdenes LX200. Esbille <tt>LX200 xenéricu</tt> pa remanar esos preseos."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, telescopePageInfo)
#: indi/telescopewizard.ui:313
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h3>2. Align Your Telescope</h3>\n"
"\n"
"You need to align your telescope before you can control it properly from "
"KStars. Please refer to your telescope manual for alignment instructions.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"After a successful alignment, connect your telescope's RS232 interface to "
"your computer's serial or USB port.\n"
"<br><br><br>Click next to continue."
msgstr ""
"<h3>2. Alinee su telescopiu</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Ye necesario alliniar el so telescopiu enantes de poder remanalu "
"afayadizamente dende KStars. Consulte nel manual del so telescopiu les "
"instrucciones sobre l'alliniación.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"Dempués d'una alliniación correuta, coneute l'interface RS232 del so "
"telescopiu a los puertos serie o USB del ordenador.\n"
"<br><br><br>Calque «Siguiente» pa continuar."

